@startuml
actor User
participant Controller
participant GoodsService
participant GoodsMapper
participant BaseFunction

User -> Controller: 发起获取餐品详情请求
activate Controller
Controller -> GoodsService: 调用goodsDetail方法
activate GoodsService
GoodsService -> GoodsMapper: 调用selectGoodsByAppFromId方法查询餐品详情
activate GoodsMapper
GoodsMapper --> GoodsService: 返回餐品详情查询结果
deactivate GoodsMapper
alt 餐品图片非空
    GoodsService -> BaseFunction: 调用stringToList方法处理餐品图片
    activate BaseFunction
    BaseFunction --> GoodsService: 返回处理后的餐品图片列表
    deactivate BaseFunction
else 餐品图片为空
    GoodsService -> GoodsService: 不做处理
end
GoodsService -> GoodsService: 查询餐品评价总数
GoodsService --> Controller: 返回处理后的餐品详情
deactivate GoodsService
Controller --> User: 返回餐品详情结果
deactivate Controller
@enduml
